---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle="luizhtc GitHub User Page">
  <main class="home-layout">
    <h1>Hello, world!</h1>

    <article class="intro-card">
      Me chamo Luiz Henrique, sou um desenvolvedor brasileiro atualmente trabalhando
      como Data Engineer. Por conta da minha experiência e carreira, trabalho
      principalmente com projetos orientados a dados, construo esteiras DataOps e MLOps
      e gosto bastante de construir e trabalhar com agentes e workflows de IA.
    </article>

    <section class="links-card">
      <h2>Links massas</h2>
      <nav class="resource-links" aria-label="Links e credenciais">
        <a class="resource-link" href="https://github.com/luizhtc?tab=repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="resource-link__icon" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span>
          <span class="resource-link__copy"><strong>Repositórios</strong><small>Projetos no GitHub</small></span>
          <span class="resource-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-link" href="https://www.credential.net/profile/luizhenriquetrincacaldo30282/wallet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="resource-link__icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</span>
          <span class="resource-link__copy"><strong>Credenciais Accredible</strong><small>Minha carteira de credenciais Accredible</small></span>
          <span class="resource-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-link" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/pt-br/users/luizhtc/transcript/vmpw6flokoop3l9" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="resource-link__icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span>
          <span class="resource-link__copy"><strong>Microsoft Learn</strong><small>Meu transcript de credenciais no Microsoft Learn</small></span>
          <span class="resource-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="resource-link" href="https://www.credly.com/users/luiz-henrique-trinca-caldo/badges/credly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="resource-link__icon" aria-hidden="true">✹</span>
          <span class="resource-link__copy"><strong>Credly</strong><small>Minha carteira de credenciais no Credly</small></span>
          <span class="resource-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </main>

</BaseLayout>
